<title>LUXEMBOURG: EU reappoints Moratinos as Mideast envoy.</title>
<headline>EU reappoints Moratinos as Mideast envoy.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union foreign ministers on Thursday reappointed for an extra year Spanish diplomat Miguel Angel Moratinos as the bloc's Middle East envoy.</p>
<p>They said in a statement that they had extended Moratinos' term for one year from its November 25 expiration.</p>
<p>Moratinos was appointed special envoy to the region last year.</p>
<p>He was given a mandate to observe the peace process, establish relations with Israeli and Palestinian negotiators and to report on possible EU actions.</p>
<p>Moratinos was previously Spain's ambassador to Israel.</p>
</text>
